<title>USA: Healthdyne stake held by Dickstein group.</title>
<headline>Healthdyne stake held by Dickstein group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including the New York investment firm Dickstein &amp; Co. L.P. said Thursday it holds a 7.6 percent stake or 999,000 common shares in Healthdyne Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said holds shares in the Marietta, Ga. company for investment purposes.</p>
<p>Members of the group most recently acquired 765,000  shares between May 12 and June 24 at $14.50 to $17.06 each.</p>
